"                                                                                                    "
"╭ ? Keybindings ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮"
"│ Movement                                                                                         │"
"│  ← / h    Switch focus to left panel                                                             │"
"│  → / l    Switch focus to right panel                                                            │"
"│  j / ↓   Move cursor down within focused panel                                                   │"
"│  k / ↑   Move cursor up within focused panel                                                     │"
"│  g         Jump to top of right panel list                                                       │"
"│  G         Jump to bottom of right panel list                                                    │"
"│  Tab       Toggle focus between left and right panel                                             │"
"│  1–4       Jump to section: 1=Segments  2=Theme  3=Style  4=Thresholds                           │"
"│                                                                                                  │"
"│ Segments                                                                                         │"
"│  Space     Toggle segment enabled/disabled                                                       │"
"│  m         Enter reorder mode (enabled segments only)                                            │"
"│                                                                                                  │"
"│ Reorder mode                                                                                     │"
"│  j / ↓     Move segment down                                                                     │"
"│  k / ↑     Move segment up                                                                       │"
"│  m / Enter Exit reorder mode (commit)                                                            │"
"│  Esc       Exit reorder mode (commit + flash)                                                    │"
"│                                                                                                  │"
"│ Thresholds                                                                                       │"
"╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯"
"┌ Preview — typical ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│ ~/p/claude-code-statusline  ◈ Opus 4.8  high  󰍛 ━━━━╌╌ 67% 󰰩 42.3k  󰔟 ━━╌╌╌╌ 48% ↺ 2h46m     │"
"└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
"                                                                                                    "
"  [←→] panel  [↑↓] section  [1–4] jump  [s] save  [?] help  [q] quit                                "
